{"4220510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCICRY", "steam_appid": 4220510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION-HORROR ON A SPACE STATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCICRY is a sci-fi action game with survival elements set in an atmosphere of technological horror. A disaster struck the base: anomalies opened a portal to another dimension, and the scientific complex turned into a zone of total slaughter. Those who survived the initial chaos now envy those whose suffering is already over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY AND ROLE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Class III engineer-welder, trapped on the station after the disaster. Everything around is failing: life support systems are malfunctioning, and horrifying creatures roam the corridors. The crew has disappeared, leaving only fragmented records of a hasty evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJECTIVES AND CHALLENGES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore corridors, laboratories, technical modules, and portals to another dimension;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restore power systems to open locked areas;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search for weapons, medkits, ammunition, keys, and upgrade components;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade weapons and suit to survive increasing threats;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight infected, mutating in different stages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >confront monsters from another world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover the secrets of the station’s experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat in the style of classic sci-fi shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be found on the station. Each weapon is effective against certain types of enemies. The player’s arsenal includes: assault rifle, shotgun, flamethrower, machine gun, rocket launcher, sniper rifle, and a unique experimental tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon upgrade system allows enhancing key parameters: damage, fire rate, accuracy, stability, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit upgrades: health, protection, damage, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering and inventory management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several types of doors: keycard, button-activated, and power-dependent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies with unique infection stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere of an alternative Soviet scientific station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of laboratories, engineering blocks, technical modules, and anomalous zones.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION-HORROR ON A SPACE STATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/d2140c66e4b3a0abcd1f874ff83ebcd5.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCICRY is a sci-fi action game with survival elements set in an atmosphere of technological horror. A disaster struck the base: anomalies opened a portal to another dimension, and the scientific complex turned into a zone of total slaughter. Those who survived the initial chaos now envy those whose suffering is already over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY AND ROLE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Class III engineer-welder, trapped on the station after the disaster. Everything around is failing: life support systems are malfunctioning, and horrifying creatures roam the corridors. The crew has disappeared, leaving only fragmented records of a hasty evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/883d13afec10b1f03498270d7ed93df9.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBJECTIVES AND CHALLENGES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore corridors, laboratories, technical modules, and portals to another dimension;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restore power systems to open locked areas;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search for weapons, medkits, ammunition, keys, and upgrade components;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade weapons and suit to survive increasing threats;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight infected, mutating in different stages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >confront monsters from another world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover the secrets of the station’s experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.poster.avif?t=1771622414\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.webm?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/extras/41c12781b5b09f2abd77f0baa1e45452.mp4?t=1771622414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat in the style of classic sci-fi shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be found on the station. Each weapon is effective against certain types of enemies. The player’s arsenal includes: assault rifle, shotgun, flamethrower, machine gun, rocket launcher, sniper rifle, and a unique experimental tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon upgrade system allows enhancing key parameters: damage, fire rate, accuracy, stability, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit upgrades: health, protection, damage, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering and inventory management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several types of doors: keycard, button-activated, and power-dependent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies with unique infection stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere of an alternative Soviet scientific station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of laboratories, engineering blocks, technical modules, and anomalous zones.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A first-person sci-fi action-horror. After a catastrophic event, the station’s crew has mutated, turning its corridors into a deadly labyrinth. Explore the station, scavenge resources, and fight monsters to survive.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/2f933b232c2bed653a913ff1eb7cde1b3046a260/header.jpg?t=1771622414", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/e82af30012f446c4549d894a5be076f690cf6206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771622414", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220510/e82af30012f446c4549d894a5be076f690cf6206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771622414", "website": "https://t.me/INDIUSHATINA", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400/AMD FX-8320 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 4GB/AMD Radeon R9 290 4GB or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770/AMD FX-8350 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong